|cinnamon sticks]]\n* ½ cup peach schnapps (optional)\n* Cinnamon sticks for [[Cookbook:Garnish|garnish]] (optional)\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Combine juice, brown sugar, cinnamon sticks, and margarine in a [[Cookbook:Dutch Oven|Dutch Oven]].\n# Heat to [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n# Remove from heat.\n# Discard cinnamon sticks.\n# Add schnapps, if desired.\n# Garnish with additional cinnamon sticks, if desired.\n\n[[Category:Camping recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for alcoholic beverages]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Hot Peach Drink","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 bottle (40 ounces) pure peach drink","sourceText":"1 bottle (40 ounces) pure peach drink","amountText":"1 bottle (40 ounces) pure peach drink","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ cup packed brown sugar","sourceText":"¼ cup packed brown sugar","amountText":"¼ cup packed brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 cinnamon sticks","sourceText":"2 cinnamon sticks","amountText":"2 cinnamon sticks","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ cup peach schnapps (optional)","sourceText":"½ cup peach schnapps (optional)","amountText":"½ cup peach schnapps (optional)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Cinnamon sticks for garnish (optional)","sourceText":"Cinnamon sticks for garnish (optional)","amountText":"Cinnamon sticks for garnish (optional)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Combine juice, brown sugar, cinnamon sticks, and margarine in a Dutch Oven.","sourceText":"Combine juice, brown sugar, cinnamon sticks, and margarine in a Dutch Oven.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Heat to boi